From: kraibse <33869366+kraibse@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 01:22:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] shader: lower more Ocarina compute and high-register graphics
 forms

Ported from zortos293/Lichii 35c043b3ef (fix/oot-bloom).

Adds uniform IMAD with an immediate addend (UIMAD 0x4a4), signed
REDUX.MIN/MAX, S32 RED, negated scalar F2I, packed F2IP.U8.F32 with an
RZ second source, SHF.R.U64 by an immediate, and shadow operands for the
remaining bloom-capture opcodes.

Eglantine's F2I has no unsigned byte form, so F2I.U8 (which F2IP lowers
to) gets the float clamp to [0, 255] that Lichii's F2I uses. The
bounded-control write_count table is not ported; Eglantine does not
have that call proof.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (ported the upstream patch hunks and resolved conflicts)
(cherry picked from commit 3f065ef733e3c2b889ccd3ad54705ec6af8b13dd)
